%% ~102s job on a 2s timer. metricsTickGate.ts is a new, pure, vscode-free
%% module owned by PANEL (one instance, a private field surviving across
%% ticks) that decides whether a tick may recompute: never while a
%% computation for the same subject (target path) is still running, and not
